"P886642225" "Providence acts: I see a potential ally. <em>But what draws {VillainName} here? <em>Searching for something, perhaps?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CAPTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CAPTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4076535864" "When you are one of us, your feet will stay on the ground."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CAPTOR_ACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CAPTOR_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4165349148" "We shall make you one of us as well!"

