// SayOnRescue :
"P1362684820" "As a mystic of the Mu, I can sense many things. <em>I sense now that you seek some information here, the same as I. <em>Let us then search together."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - SayOnArrival 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - SayOnRecapture 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SayOnRecapture :
"P1254508406" "How unlikely a situation is this?"

