"P1094158240" "No disturbances out here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Books 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1778979957" "Books"
// Description :
"P3908957328" "books of research"
// SingularDescription :
"P3266408042" "Find last book"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1412581140" "You begin searching through the books"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2175462240" "You finished searching through the books"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P873328114" "You found some information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3946037528" "You got all of the research"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P290620709" "A-HA! There! There, you see! The Legacy Chain's research says it all! Ghost Widow is bound to Paolo! She needs him as an anchor in this world and cannot let him go! <br><br>Do not try to tell me that they are in disagreement about it in the papers. Do not point out the dissension among their researchers. I can feel that this must be true. No, I KNOW it to be true from the depths of my heart. She whom I once called friend, whom both Paolo and I called 'sister'; she torments his life to extend her own unlife! <br><br>I will get this to our allies. Then, she will pay for all that she has done to Paolo and me. <br><br>I swear, she will pay!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1526390673" "I heard {VillainName} broke into a business meeting, beat everyone up, and stole some books. That's so random."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P332697175" "Our allies need assistance. Ohanko is about to be questioned on charges of conspiracy, and a body must be disposed of before it's evidence betrays us all. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Enter the base, and amid the havoc free Ohanko and remove the body.</A> Once you're back, they will begin planning against Ghost Widow, and I will see my revenge begin."
// AcceptString :
"P4218173798" "Free Ohanko and remove evidence"
// SendOffString :
"P4012060127" "Ohanko is about to be taken in for questioning. You must give him a reasonable amount of chaos to escape in. At the least, defeat the base commander, free Ohanko, and remove the evidence. <br><br>Our allies have brought us into their cabal, and when Ghost Widow falls and Paolo is free from his misery, I will make certain that you are rewarded for all that you have done. Now go, and get Huntsman Ohanko out of jeopardy."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3805348560" "Protect Ohanko"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3277252842" "Ohanko is about to be taken in for questioning. You must give him a reasonable amount of chaos to escape in. At the least, defeat the base commander, free Ohanko, and remove the 'evidence'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P722660743" "You have to wonder what Huntsman Ohanko could have done to get himself in this much trouble."

