// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 8 N_Victim :
"P2528641898" "<f=B_Caster>Did you come here to die, Huntsman Ohanko? <em=GoAway>I can think of no other reason for this intrusion.<em=CrossArms>"
// 8 B_Caster :
"P2989464757" "<f=N_Victim><em=Point>I'm here to destroy you, Ghost Widow. <em=Explain>But unlike some of the others, this isn't personal for me. <em=Thumbsup>I'm only in this for the power."
// 4 N_Victim :
"P2264001145" "<em=EvilLaugh>Destroy me? Others have tried, Ohanko, and they have all perished."
// 6 B_Caster :
"P947492471" "<em=ThreatHand>Ah, but now we know how it works! We destroy you here, and then we kill Wretch before you can re-form. <em=SlashThroat>You'll just fade away into nothing!"
// 8 N_Victim :
"P184949064" "<f=B_Caster><em=Laugh>Is that your plan? <em=CrossArms>Fools! <em=Lecture>You've got it all wrong. Even if you could hurt my dear Wretch, he's not the anchor you imagine him to be."
// 8 N_Victim :
"P88010792" "<em=no>My Spirit is not bound to Wretch, Ohanko. <em=explain>I died worrying about poor Paolo and the dead cannot change. <em>I'll always care for him and, in what's left of his mind, he for me. <em=CrossArms>But I don't need him."
// 2 B_Caster :
"P1367573431" "<em=CurseYou>She's lying!"
// 4 N_Victim :
"P258954492" "<em=Explain>My spirit is bound to Arachnos itself. As long as Arachnos exists, I will exist."
// 4 B_Caster :
"P1843046942" "<f=N_Victim><em=Point>It's not true! We've seen the research!"
// 4 N_Victim :
"P1454261295" "<em=Nod>But you, Ohanko... <em=slash>Your end is coming soon..."
// 4 B_Caster :
"P50644544" "<em=disagree>Ignore her lies! <em>Begin the ceremony!"
// 4 N_Victim :
"P1443277106" "And its name is {VillainName}!"

